        <p>TOWNSHIP OF GRAPPENHALL. COUNTY WAR AGRICULTURAL COMMITTEE. DISTRIBUTION OF SEED POTATOES. THE BOARD OF AGRICULTURE propose to Supply and Distribute through the above Com- mittee SCOTCH SEED POTATOES to Allotment Holders and Small Cultivators. Seed Potatoes will be delivered at convenient centres in 1 cwt.' bags, not more than 5 cwt. to be supplied to any one person; and any person requir- ing less than 1 cwt. must combine with others to share a 1 cwt. bag. Varieties of Seed available, prices and method of payment and details of delivery will be determined later by the Board. The above Committee desire information at once of the 'quantity required by the above Township of Grappenhall. Persons residing in the above Township requiring; Seed Potatoes , kindly ,supply particulars of quan- tity necessary not later than Monday, Bth January, 1917, to F. A. FROST, , Chaiiman of Parish Council, GrappeLhall Hall; or to CHAS. H. HOULT, Clerk to Parish Council, Glendon, Victoria Avenue, Grappenhall.</p>
